{"title":"Career roadmap · Financial Analyst","role":"Financial Analyst","summary":"A Financial Analyst analyses financial statements, business performance, budgets, investments, forecasts and market information to support financial and business decisions. For a BA Economics student, this is a strong career option because economics provides the foundation in markets, macroeconomics, microeconomics, statistics and quantitative reasoning.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[{"type":"table","header":["Item","Roadmap"],"rows":[[{"text":"Starting point"},{"text":"Year 1 UG · 2026"}],[{"text":"Degree"},{"text":"BA Economics / BA Economics Honours"}],[{"text":"Target career"},{"text":"Financial Analyst"}],[{"text":"Career cluster"},{"text":"Humanities & Social Sciences → Economics → Finance"}],[{"text":"Core academic areas"},{"text":"Economics, Statistics, Mathematics, Finance, Accounting"}],[{"text":"Technical stack"},{"text":"Excel, financial modelling, PowerPoint, SQL, Power BI, Python"}],[{"text":"Finance stack"},{"text":"Financial statements, corporate finance, valuation, markets"}],[{"text":"Strong entry routes"},{"text":"Finance internship → Analyst/Associate"}],[{"text":"Professional qualifications"},{"text":"CFA, NISM and other role-specific qualifications"}],[{"text":"Long-term direction"},{"text":"Senior Financial Analyst → Finance Manager / Investment / Corporate Finance / FP&A"}]]}],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Finance internships, research roles, FP&A internships, financial-data roles"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Financial Analyst / FP&A / Equity Research / Risk / Corporate Finance"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Senior Analyst → Finance Manager / Specialist"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Strategic finance, investment analysis, AI-enabled financial decision-making"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Ove